{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o041a","title":"王凌任司空","accounts":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o041a-account","label":"《三少帝纪》正文","text":"王凌任司空","evidence":["shaodi-e-o041a-q"]},{"id":"wgc-a-0-e20","label":"正文","text":"王凌就迁司空","evidence":["wgc-q0163","wgc-q0006"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0004","role":"受任","evidence":["shaodi-e-o041a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":248,"label":"秋九月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"shaodi-y248","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"shaodi-q-o039","basis":"秋九月"},"evidence":["shaodi-e-o041a-q","shaodi-q-o039","shaodi-q-b-60775abea476f875fc24"]},"ordering_evidence":"shaodi-e-o041a-q","source_order":[4,152,"O041a"],"order":1051}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0004","name":"王凌","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o041a-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-5b6337d25cd331278650","layer":"original","quote":"秋九月，以车骑将军王凌为司空。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":151,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":15,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-60775abea476f875fc24","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-60775abea476f875fc24","layer":"modern","quote":"〖21〗九年：正始九年（公元 248）。参照下文，在“二月”之后应当有记日的干支。此处史文疑有脱落。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":174,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8324fe8afd82c8552b28","start":0,"end":50,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o039","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-e10813740402816008fd","layer":"original","quote":"九年春二月〖21〗，卫将军、中书令孙资；癸巳〖22〗，骠骑将军、中书监刘放；三月甲午〖23〗，司徒卫臻：各逊位，以侯就第〖24〗，位特进〖25〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":149,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":73,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0006","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-48d8a8c3b1b7a3ef24e8","layer":"original","quote":"是时，凌外甥令狐愚以才能为兖州刺史，屯平阿〖3〗。舅甥并典兵，专淮南之重。凌就迁为司空〖4〗。司马宣王既诛曹爽，进凌为太尉，假节、钺。凌、愚密协计，谓齐王不任天位〖5〗，楚王彪长而才〖6〗，欲迎立彪都许昌。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":22,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":103,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0163","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-48d8a8c3b1b7a3ef24e8","layer":"original","quote":"凌就迁为司空","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":22,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":37,"end":43,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
